---
// Workshops / Talleres section
---

<section class="workshops crochet-bg-workshop" id="talleres">
  <div class="workshops-inner">

    <div class="workshops-text">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">✦ Clases personalizadas</p>
      <h2 class="workshops-title">Taller de<br/><em>Crochet 1 a 1</em></h2>
      <p class="workshops-lead">
        Ofrezco talleres de crochet personalizados, adaptados a tu nivel y
        a lo que querés aprender. Desde los primeros puntos hasta técnicas
        más complejas.
      </p>
      <ul class="workshops-features">
        <li>
          <span class="feat-icon">◎</span>
          <div>
            <strong>100% personalizado</strong>
            <p>Trabajamos a tu ritmo, con los proyectos que más te gustan.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="feat-icon">◎</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Online o presencial</strong>
            <p>Vos elegís el formato que mejor se adapte a tu vida.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="feat-icon">◎</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Todos los niveles</strong>
            <p>Principiantes absolutas y quienes quieren perfeccionarse.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#contacto" class="workshops-cta">
        Consultá por el taller →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="workshops-visual crochet-bg-alt">
      <div class="workshops-deco">
        <!-- Decoración geométrica tipo tejido -->
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="deco-svg">
          <g stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.25)" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5">
            <!-- Grilla hexagonal estilizada -->
            <polygon points="100,20 140,42 140,87 100,109 60,87 60,42" stroke-width="2"/>
            <polygon points="100,45 125,58 125,83 100,96 75,83 75,58" stroke-width="1"/>
            <circle cx="100" cy="70" r="12"/>
            <circle cx="100" cy="70" r="5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" stroke="none"/>
            <!-- Radiales -->
            <line x1="100" y1="20" x2="100" y2="5"/>
            <line x1="140" y1="42" x2="153" y2="34"/>
            <line x1="140" y1="87" x2="153" y2="95"/>
            <line x1="100" y1="109" x2="100" y2="122"/>
            <line x1="60" y1="87" x2="47" y2="95"/>
            <line x1="60" y1="42" x2="47" y2="34"/>
            <!-- Decorativos exteriores -->
            <circle cx="100" cy="5" r="3" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.4)" stroke="none"/>
            <circle cx="153" cy="34" r="3" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.4)" stroke="none"/>
            <circle cx="153" cy="95" r="3" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.4)" stroke="none"/>
            <circle cx="100" cy="122" r="3" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.4)" stroke="none"/>
            <circle cx="47" cy="95" r="3" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.4)" stroke="none"/>
            <circle cx="47" cy="34" r="3" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.4)" stroke="none"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <p class="deco-quote">
          "Aprender crochet<br/>es aprender a<br/><em>crear con calma.</em>"
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .workshops {
    background: var(--cream);
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .workshops-inner {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--violet);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .workshops-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .workshops-title em {
    color: var(--violet);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .workshops-lead {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  .workshops-features {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .workshops-features li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .feat-icon {
    color: var(--violet);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .workshops-features strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .workshops-features p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .workshops-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--violet);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--violet-dark);
  }

  .workshops-cta:hover {
    background: var(--violet-dark);
    transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--burgundy);
  }

  /* Right side visual */
  .workshops-visual {
    border-radius: 2px 60px 2px 60px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 360px;
  }

  .workshops-deco {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @keyframes floatDeco {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
  }

  .deco-quote {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .deco-quote em {
    color: var(--cream-dark);
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .workshops-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .workshops-visual {
      min-height: 240px;
    }
  }

  
</style>